---
title: Registry
description: How components are cataloged, and what's next for distribution.
order: 2
---

Every component, block, and utility lives under `registry/items/<section>/<name>/`, with three files:

- `_registry.svx` — frontmatter metadata plus a prose usage guide.
- `_preview.svelte` — the live demo rendered on this site and reused as the "Code" tab's source.
- `stories/<name>.stories.svelte` — a Storybook story for the same component.

The catalog is built at request time with Vite's `import.meta.glob`, so adding a new item is just adding a new folder — no build step or manifest to hand-maintain.

## CLI distribution (coming later)

A hosted `registry.json` and per-item `/r/<name>.json` endpoints, so this registry can be installed into other projects the same way `shadcn-svelte add` works today, are planned for a later phase. The "Install → CLI" tab on each item page is a placeholder until then.
